// Lucide icons (lucide-static 1.48.0, ISC; assets/icons/LICENSE), one
// property per icon. They are black strokes: tint them with `colorize`
// (the `Icon` component does). Add an icon by copying its SVG from Lucide
// into assets/icons/ and adding a line here.

